      "docs": "Generic function to validate data table row.\n@param\tContext\tthe context holding validation warnings/errors.\n@return\tValid if this table row has data validation rules set up for it and the data for this object is valid.\nReturns Invalid if it does not pass the rules. Returns NotValidated if no rules are set for this object.",
      "supportedTargets": [
        "FTableRowBase*",
        "UDataTable*"
      ]
    },
